(7634717, 1238386, 103142, '<td valign="top">I really like how you edited this. The texture on the wing is wonderful. It doesn''t bother me, but I know that some people would think the top of the head and the little area on the neck are blown. I always look at things like that and see if it can be brought back (simply because people seem to hone in on that). But as I said, it doesn''t bother me.<br/> <br/>The only nit I have to pick is the cropping. It seems squished on the right. If you want to keep the whole tail, is there more on the bottom you could bring in? Perhaps putting the babies on the rule of thirds line might give it more space? I''d rather crop in from the left, though.</td>', 'I really like how you edited this. The texture on the wing is wonderful. It doesn''t bother me, but I know that some people would think the top of the head and the little area on the neck are blown. I always look at things like that and see if it can be brought back (simply because people seem to hone in on that). But as I said, it doesn''t bother me. The only nit I have to pick is the cropping. It seems squished on the right. If you want to keep the whole tail, is there more on the bottom you could bring in? Perhaps putting the babies on the rule of thirds line might give it more space? I''d rather crop in from the left, though.', '2019-07-11 17:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7634718, 1237978, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m having a hard time voting on this challenge.  In my opinion, the hardest part of this challenge was in the description: "A happy color: make a photo with just a touch of yellow as an accent." The yellow here isn''t just a touch or an accent -- it''s the main feature. Sorry. :(</td>', 'I''m having a hard time voting on this challenge.  In my opinion, the hardest part of this challenge was in the description: "A happy color: make a photo with just a touch of yellow as an accent." The yellow here isn''t just a touch or an accent -- it''s the main feature. Sorry. :(', '2019-07-11 17:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7634719, 1237984, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very funky/cool -- and someone that read the whole description! This is just a touch for an accent!!! -8-</td>', 'Very funky/cool -- and someone that read the whole description! This is just a touch for an accent!!! -8-', '2019-07-11 17:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
