(7634792, 1238269, 24454, '<td valign="top">When I was looking thru the photos in this challenge, I stopped on this one mesmerized.  It is so incredibly beautiful.  I thought maybe I had seen the little girl in one of your other posts, and it has your wonderful soft but edgy style.  I''m surprised it isn''t one of the winners!  I''m like you, I never vote in challenges I have an entry in... I think if you check out the "average vote for participants" and the "average non-participants", it''s easy to see that our philosophy is a good one.  But I am disappointed that this gorgeous photo didn''t win!</td>', 'When I was looking thru the photos in this challenge, I stopped on this one mesmerized.  It is so incredibly beautiful.  I thought maybe I had seen the little girl in one of your other posts, and it has your wonderful soft but edgy style.  I''m surprised it isn''t one of the winners!  I''m like you, I never vote in challenges I have an entry in... I think if you check out the "average vote for participants" and the "average non-participants", it''s easy to see that our philosophy is a good one.  But I am disappointed that this gorgeous photo didn''t win!', '2019-07-12 01:11:59.000000', NULL, 0),
