(7634868, 1238269, 67145, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> Gorgeous Roz, I''m sure her parents love this, I hope they print it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SandyP:</b></div><hr/><i> When I was looking thru the photos in this challenge, I stopped on this one mesmerized.  It is so incredibly beautiful.  I thought maybe I had seen the little girl in one of your other posts, and it has your wonderful soft but edgy style.  I''m surprised it isn''t one of the winners!  I''m like you, I never vote in challenges I have an entry in... I think if you check out the "average vote for participants" and the "average non-participants", it''s easy to see that our philosophy is a good one.  But I am disappointed that this gorgeous photo didn''t win! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jomari:</b></div><hr/><i> If it had just been up to me this would have had a ribbon. It is so beautiful. It meets the challenge well too. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/><b>thankyou so much guys .. and thankyou for the two favourites .. totally makes up for the less than great place this came in the challenge .. i loved it .. and it looks like you did too .. thats whats important .. xxx</b></td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: Gorgeous Roz, I''m sure her parents love this, I hope they print it.   Originally posted by SandyP: When I was looking thru the photos in this challenge, I stopped on this one mesmerized.  It is so incredibly beautiful.  I thought maybe I had seen the little girl in one of your other posts, and it has your wonderful soft but edgy style.  I''m surprised it isn''t one of the winners!  I''m like you, I never vote in challenges I have an entry in... I think if you check out the "average vote for participants" and the "average non-participants", it''s easy to see that our philosophy is a good one.  But I am disappointed that this gorgeous photo didn''t win!   Originally posted by jomari: If it had just been up to me this would have had a ribbon. It is so beautiful. It meets the challenge well too.   thankyou so much guys .. and thankyou for the two favourites .. totally makes up for the less than great place this came in the challenge .. i loved it .. and it looks like you did too .. thats whats important .. xxx', '2019-07-13 02:50:35.000000', NULL, 0),
